WEBVTT

00:16.959 --> 00:19.757
Wh-What on earth is going on?

00:19.929 --> 00:22.090
We're in big trouble!

00:22.165 --> 00:25.225
The explosion has ripped apart
the ceiling of the slums!

00:26.035 --> 00:26.933
What?!

00:27.170 --> 00:30.731
At this rate, all of us will be
crushed under the ceiling!

00:30.807 --> 00:31.330
What?!

00:31.407 --> 00:32.567
There's no way out!

00:32.842 --> 00:34.366
We're doomed!

00:35.144 --> 00:37.635
That might not be all.

00:38.081 --> 00:39.810
The destruction
of the Underground?!

00:46.923 --> 00:49.391
Isn't there any way
we can save ourselves?

00:49.459 --> 00:52.895
In a closed space like this,
there's nowhere we can escape to...

00:52.962 --> 00:54.589
...if the ceiling collapses.

00:55.398 --> 00:58.299
No, there's one way.

00:59.736 --> 01:03.103
This stadium is
the strongest structure here.

01:03.706 --> 01:07.608
If we all go to the roof
of the dome...

01:07.677 --> 01:11.374
...and protect this stadium
from falling debris, then...

01:11.881 --> 01:13.872
You think we can really do that?

01:14.383 --> 01:17.181
I wonder what our chances
for survival are.

01:17.253 --> 01:20.188
Even if it's a long shot,
we still have to try.

01:20.256 --> 01:21.188
Let's hurry!

01:23.793 --> 01:26.785
Ginnosuke, are you afraid?

01:27.396 --> 01:30.263
I'm fine.
Everyone is with me, after all.

01:31.200 --> 01:33.725
It seems that you've
gotten stronger, Ginnosuke.

01:34.904 --> 01:35.632
Yes.

01:36.472 --> 01:37.939
Oh, well.

01:38.341 --> 01:40.775
I guess we really have
no choice but to try.

01:41.144 --> 01:42.338
I'll go!

01:42.945 --> 01:46.312
We'll bring to this stadium
the people of the slums...

01:46.382 --> 01:47.781
...who aren't here.

01:48.084 --> 01:49.278
Leave it to us!

01:50.653 --> 01:51.381
Huh?

01:51.921 --> 01:53.411
Is that you, Bro?

01:55.224 --> 01:56.384
Keep it down!

01:56.926 --> 01:59.224
What're you doing here?

01:59.529 --> 02:01.394
I've infiltrated the enemy...

02:01.464 --> 02:03.557
...and I'm waiting
for my opportunity.

02:03.633 --> 02:06.534
You were able to fool them
with that face of yours?

02:06.602 --> 02:09.332
I mean, this isn't the time
to be playing games!

02:12.175 --> 02:16.077
What is this unsettling feeling
that I've been having.

02:16.612 --> 02:17.476
Ginnosuke...

02:18.281 --> 02:19.373
What's the matter?

02:23.052 --> 02:24.041
I'm sorry.

02:24.754 --> 02:26.551
Please go on ahead!

02:27.290 --> 02:28.757
Uh, Ginnosuke!

02:56.953 --> 03:02.050
HEY YOU!
Shiraketa kao de nageite iru dake ja

03:03.025 --> 03:07.553
tabun nani mo hajimara nai
nige wa shinaide

03:08.497 --> 03:14.663
hashiri dashite iru mirai ga
aruno nara

03:14.737 --> 03:20.801
fukaku ochi konderu
hima wa nai

03:20.877 --> 03:27.146
hito wa sou daremo ga
toki to shite mayoi

03:27.216 --> 03:33.086
atae rareta hibi wo
tada ikite iru kedo

03:33.155 --> 03:39.287
ushinatte wa nara nai mono

03:39.362 --> 03:45.392
kakaete mamotte kizu tsuite

03:45.468 --> 03:51.600
sore demo mata aruki daseru

03:51.674 --> 03:58.375
chikara wo shinji teru yo

04:04.086 --> 04:08.182
Toward the Light - United Ambitions

04:14.964 --> 04:15.862
That's...

04:27.877 --> 04:31.608
The undefeatable king of fighting,
Rumina Asagi, is here!

04:36.886 --> 04:37.818
Rumina!

04:38.454 --> 04:40.786
I want Ruri back, Pairon!

04:43.693 --> 04:44.557
Hold it!

05:05.381 --> 05:06.177
Pairon!

05:09.251 --> 05:10.650
Wind User...

05:14.290 --> 05:18.158
It looks like I've
underestimated you all this time.

05:19.595 --> 05:23.087
But my relationship with you
shall end right now!

05:26.068 --> 05:27.899
Let's settle this!

05:29.705 --> 05:31.138
I've been waiting!

05:44.120 --> 05:47.715
Vanish! Everything shall vanish!

05:50.059 --> 05:50.787
Kashin...

05:52.328 --> 05:55.820
Seki, Kashin is gone...

05:56.465 --> 05:57.363
However...

05:59.502 --> 06:02.335
Traitors, are you still alive?

06:02.872 --> 06:05.363
I've never betrayed anyone.

06:06.075 --> 06:06.734
What?

06:07.243 --> 06:10.041
Even now, I act as
the Maiden's protector.

06:10.413 --> 06:12.745
You're the one who betrayed us,
Kashin!

06:15.351 --> 06:19.253
We still have a chance to return
the Company to what it was.

06:19.321 --> 06:23.519
Kashin, let's join together
and make this Underground...

06:25.327 --> 06:26.419
Shut up!

06:32.268 --> 06:36.102
May you traitors go to hell!

06:36.172 --> 06:36.866
Chelsea!

06:42.645 --> 06:44.909
You saved us, Nerdy Guy!

06:45.448 --> 06:47.109
It's Ginnosuke.

06:47.183 --> 06:49.879
I'm not even wearing my glasses.

06:50.086 --> 06:51.713
That man was on the surface...

06:51.787 --> 06:54.620
There's no time to explain now.

06:54.824 --> 06:56.519
Just give me a hand.
Right now!

06:56.959 --> 06:57.823
Right.

07:13.075 --> 07:16.169
Asagi Swordsmanship
Wind Storm!

07:17.179 --> 07:18.009
Wall!

07:25.154 --> 07:26.416
Cascade!

07:33.028 --> 07:34.290
Flood!

07:45.674 --> 07:46.572
Rumina!

07:54.216 --> 07:55.148
What?!

08:00.723 --> 08:01.781
How can that be?

08:01.857 --> 08:05.122
Has he seen right through
all of my techniques?

08:10.366 --> 08:11.458
N-Not again.

08:11.600 --> 08:15.058
How can a kid like that
drive so much fear into me?

08:19.375 --> 08:20.399
Stay back!

08:33.722 --> 08:36.247
H-How can this be?

08:41.096 --> 08:42.188
Rumina!

08:47.469 --> 08:48.595
Rumina...

08:48.671 --> 08:49.797
Ruri...

08:50.105 --> 08:51.868
Are you okay, Ruri?

08:54.109 --> 08:56.043
Don't cry, Ruri.

08:56.111 --> 08:57.043
I'm sorry.

08:58.347 --> 08:59.644
I was so scared.

08:59.949 --> 09:00.608
Yeah.

09:00.916 --> 09:01.883
I'm sure.

09:05.521 --> 09:06.510
No.

09:08.023 --> 09:10.491
What I was scared about...

09:10.559 --> 09:13.790
...was never being able to
see your smiling faces again.

09:15.798 --> 09:18.426
I was so afraid of...

09:18.500 --> 09:22.869
...turning those happy moments
of the past into mere memories.

09:23.639 --> 09:24.571
I see.

09:24.907 --> 09:26.602
But you're all right now.

09:28.110 --> 09:30.044
Let's go to the surface together.

09:32.514 --> 09:33.173
Yes!

09:37.152 --> 09:39.620
I had a feeling this would happen.

09:47.596 --> 09:48.460
You snake.

10:11.954 --> 10:14.184
Emergency notice!
Emergency notice!

10:14.256 --> 10:17.225
People of the slums, evacuate
to the dome immediately!

10:17.626 --> 10:18.957
Please evacuate!

10:19.561 --> 10:22.086
You really think we can
protect it like this?

10:22.364 --> 10:23.456
We have no choice.

10:23.766 --> 10:24.824
We just have to!

10:34.243 --> 10:35.369
Hey...

10:35.878 --> 10:37.311
From long ago...

10:37.379 --> 10:42.442
...I've always felt that this world
ought to be destroyed.

10:45.521 --> 10:48.581
But I think I feel differently now.

10:48.891 --> 10:49.653
Yeah.

10:50.092 --> 10:52.925
You idiot!
Don't just stand there!

10:52.995 --> 10:56.795
The priority right now is to
save as many people as we can!

10:59.568 --> 11:01.468
Dealing with debris like this...!

11:02.204 --> 11:05.435
...is easy if we combine
our strengths!

11:09.812 --> 11:12.508
What are you all doing here?!

11:12.581 --> 11:14.310
Can't you tell by looking?

11:14.383 --> 11:17.318
We're trying to save the people!

11:17.820 --> 11:19.219
Ginnosuke, hurry!

11:19.288 --> 11:21.483
I could use all the help
I can get right now!

11:21.924 --> 11:22.856
Yes!

11:36.105 --> 11:37.129
Shalma!

11:37.773 --> 11:40.173
Don't make things too hard on me.

11:40.576 --> 11:41.508
You...

11:42.444 --> 11:43.843
Don't misunderstand.

11:44.279 --> 11:48.181
I wouldn't want to get bored
because my arch-enemy died.

11:49.218 --> 11:51.049
You still don't have a chance!

11:55.591 --> 11:57.456
Now, Ginnosuke!

11:58.527 --> 11:59.858
I've got it!

12:05.701 --> 12:07.862
She finally called me
by my name.

12:15.144 --> 12:17.135
What is it with these guys?

12:17.212 --> 12:20.238
Where are they drawing
their powers from?

12:33.195 --> 12:34.184
Rumina!

12:47.843 --> 12:48.605
What?!

12:49.077 --> 12:50.840
I will not lose to you!

12:51.280 --> 12:52.941
How could this be?!

12:53.015 --> 12:55.779
He's different from
when I was fighting him before!

12:59.121 --> 13:00.281
Rumina...

13:04.760 --> 13:06.955
I used too much of my power.

13:07.696 --> 13:08.720
Rumina!

13:31.086 --> 13:32.815
At this rate,
there'll be no end to it.

13:32.888 --> 13:34.150
Don't give up!

13:34.223 --> 13:35.121
Don't give up!

13:37.125 --> 13:38.854
I will never give up!

13:38.927 --> 13:41.725
I will see the Maiden again!

13:41.997 --> 13:43.589
I promised her!

13:48.537 --> 13:49.401
That's right.

13:49.838 --> 13:53.569
We bodyguards of the Maiden
can't die and abandon Ruri!

13:56.111 --> 13:58.375
Wait for me, Ruri!

14:02.417 --> 14:03.281
Master Sui!

14:03.685 --> 14:06.245
The next target appears
to be a little too big!

14:06.688 --> 14:07.416
What?!

14:28.143 --> 14:29.440
How?

14:29.511 --> 14:32.344
How could he have gained
so much power in a short time?!

14:33.982 --> 14:35.279
I'll tell you!

14:35.817 --> 14:38.479
A righteous hero...

14:38.654 --> 14:41.020
...when in front of his girl...

14:41.089 --> 14:43.580
...is able to increase
his power many fold!

14:44.026 --> 14:44.958
Shut up!

14:45.193 --> 14:47.218
Sarasa is mine!

14:49.898 --> 14:52.662
How dare you treat her
like an object!

14:53.969 --> 14:55.994
Ruri doesn't belong to anyone!

14:56.238 --> 14:58.934
Ultimate Wind Storm!

15:17.893 --> 15:20.123
There's nothing we can do.

15:27.869 --> 15:28.995
Rumina!

15:34.977 --> 15:36.274
We did it.

15:37.346 --> 15:38.813
You hurt at all?

15:39.581 --> 15:40.343
I'm okay.

15:52.094 --> 15:52.958
Kashin?!

15:53.195 --> 15:55.026
What are you going to do?!

16:06.508 --> 16:07.372
What the...?!

16:15.150 --> 16:15.946
Ruri!

16:16.018 --> 16:17.986
Kashin! What have you done?!

16:19.921 --> 16:22.116
The time has finally come.

16:22.190 --> 16:23.919
Resurrection from
total destruction.

16:24.559 --> 16:25.491
Kashin...

16:25.927 --> 16:28.122
Revenge against the surface!

16:30.332 --> 16:32.493
I will destroy everything!

16:33.135 --> 16:34.193
Don't do it, Kashin!

16:46.181 --> 16:47.341
It's too late.

16:47.683 --> 16:49.241
The Dragons will awaken!

17:00.962 --> 17:01.894
Ruri!

17:06.001 --> 17:08.970
She's using her
power of resurrection!

17:09.037 --> 17:10.299
No, Ruri!

17:14.543 --> 17:16.602
Don't do it, Ruri!

17:17.179 --> 17:21.343
Rumina, I haven't given up yet.

17:21.516 --> 17:22.210
What?!

17:22.684 --> 17:26.643
You are going to show me a
true flower garden one day, right?

17:29.091 --> 17:33.858
And you are going to show me
that beautiful starry night sky...

17:33.929 --> 17:35.829
...like you did back then, right?

17:36.164 --> 17:38.223
Yeah! Of course!

17:38.700 --> 17:41.260
Then you have to believe in me.

17:42.437 --> 17:45.133
I'm not going to let
anyone die anymore.

17:48.777 --> 17:49.937
I will...

17:50.011 --> 17:51.911
I will save everyone!

18:00.756 --> 18:02.121
Sis...

18:05.527 --> 18:07.586
Ruri!

18:34.990 --> 18:36.048
Ruri...

18:36.458 --> 18:37.288
Ruri...

18:37.993 --> 18:38.891
Sis...

18:40.996 --> 18:42.361
It's warm...

18:42.697 --> 18:44.494
What a gentle light.

18:44.966 --> 18:46.729
Th-This is...

18:47.002 --> 18:48.094
...a miracle.

18:48.603 --> 18:49.570
This is...

18:49.638 --> 18:51.105
...the power of the Maiden.

18:51.173 --> 18:53.141
The power of resurrection.

18:53.275 --> 18:55.641
No. That's not all.

18:55.710 --> 18:56.836
This is...

18:58.113 --> 18:59.171
Ruri...

19:00.715 --> 19:02.012
Chelsea?

19:07.389 --> 19:09.653
That's right, Ruri!

19:09.891 --> 19:11.586
Let's go to the surface!

19:12.627 --> 19:15.187
To the surface, into the light!

19:26.975 --> 19:28.101
Ruri...

19:32.414 --> 19:34.439
Y-Your power...

19:36.651 --> 19:38.778
Lend me your power.

19:40.488 --> 19:41.455
Yes.

20:12.120 --> 20:12.916
Ruri...

20:17.125 --> 20:18.456
Blondie...

20:22.197 --> 20:23.357
Ginnosuke...

20:25.200 --> 20:26.428
Let's go back!

20:26.935 --> 20:28.527
Back to our home!

20:42.584 --> 20:49.012
Everyone seems to be hurt
daremo ga kizu tsuite wa

20:49.090 --> 20:55.188
And I quietly close my eyes
shjizukani hitomi tojite

20:55.797 --> 21:01.736
Even after I am asleep
nemuri ni tsuite mo mata

21:02.337 --> 21:08.401
I will never stop dreaming
yume miru koto yame nai

21:10.345 --> 21:16.648
Next to me
boku no tonari

21:16.718 --> 21:21.587
Your wish
kimi no negai

21:22.090 --> 21:29.496
To bring overflowing light
afureru hikari wo

21:29.564 --> 21:35.196
This world cast in the morning light
asa ga terasu sekai wo

21:36.037 --> 21:42.033
With flowers that bloom for eternity
eien ni saku hana de

21:42.410 --> 21:48.280
Shall be embraced with warmth
daki shimete iyou

21:49.050 --> 21:53.544
Like a prayer
inori no you ni

21:55.357 --> 22:00.624
Melting in the light
hikari ni tokete

22:15.977 --> 22:20.880
kyoumo uso no youni

22:20.949 --> 22:26.819
migakareru machi nami wo

22:26.888 --> 22:39.130
mokuteki ga aruyou ni
aruku boku

22:39.968 --> 22:50.902
naiteruno?
Honno sasayaka na kakotachi yo

22:50.979 --> 23:02.550
miagereba
DIGITAL no SCREEN ni sora ga...

23:03.224 --> 23:12.257
kaze no uta wo
takai kaidan wo nobori

23:12.333 --> 23:15.825
kikou to shita

23:15.904 --> 23:24.141
daite
amaku kizu tsuita yume ga mou

23:24.212 --> 23:32.950
same temo ii
nakanaide
